                <td>
                  <a name="x-http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-RoleCode-SIS"> </a>
                  <code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-RoleCode</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <code>SIS</code>
                </td>
                <td>sestra</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>The player of the role is a female sharing one or both parents in common with the scoping entity.</p>

                  </div>
