            <p class="res-header-id"/>
            <div style="border: black 1px dotted; background-color: #EEEEEE; padding: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px">
              <p>Expansion performed internally based on:</p>
              <ul>
                <li>
                  <a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/7.0.1/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html">codesystem NullFlavor v3.0.0 (CodeSystem)</a>
