                  <code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-RoleCode</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <code>NBOR</code>
                </td>
                <td>soused/sousedka</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>The player of the role lives near or next to the scoping person.</p>

                  </div>
